ure, family background, and home languages. Each project has the following sections:\n- the purpose of the project\n- materials suggested\n- questions for children\n- instruction to complete each section\n- additional activities and resources\nMost Popular10 Strategies for Building Relationships with ELLsUsing Cognates to Develop Comprehension in EnglishCulturally Responsive Instruction for Holiday and Religious CelebrationsLanguage Objectives: The Key to Effective Content Area Instruction for English Learners\n\n## Most Popular\n\n10 Strategies for Building Relationships with ELLsUsing Cognates to Develop Comprehension in EnglishCulturally Responsive Instruction for Holiday and Religious CelebrationsLanguage Objectives: The Key to Effective Content Area Instruction for English Learners\n10 Strategies for Building Relationships with ELLs\n10 Strategies for Building Relationships with ELLs\n\n### 10 Strategies for Building Relationships with ELLs\n\nUsing Cognates to Develop Comprehension in English\nUsing Cognates to Develop Comprehension in English\n\n### Using Cognates to Develop Comprehension in English\n\nCulturally Responsive Instruction for Holiday and Religious Celebrations\nCulturally Responsive Instruction for Holiday and Religious Celebrations\n\n### Culturally Responsive Instruction for Holiday and Religious Celebrations\n\nLanguage Objectives: The Key to Effective Content Area Instruction for English Learners\nLanguage Objectives: The Key to Effective Content Area Instruction for English Learners\n\n### Language Objectives: The Key to Effective Content Area Instruction for English Learners\n\nELL NewsCultivating Content and Language Learning in ELLsEdutopia| April 04, 2025See more headlines ›\n\n## ELL News\n\nCultivating Content and Language Learning in ELLsEdutopia| April 04, 2025\n- Cultivating Content and Language Learning in ELLsEdutopia| April 04, 2025\nEdutopia\n| April 04, 2025\nTweets by @ColorinColorado\n</tool_response>"},{"role":"assistant","